  "notes": [
    "Recommended defence/block baseline derived from solution pp. 1-4, not a proven unique optimum.",
    "Purpose is to buy time for off-map M Company, with the bridge and infantry crossing approaches covered by mutually supporting positions.",
    "Main body starts at ORV and must move into position; it is not pre-deployed or teleported to prepared defences.",
    "B Security receives no new BML mission because communications are lost; scenario standing orders represent one possible survivor response.",
    "No enemy unit IDs, exact enemy positions, ground-truth conditions, mines, barricades, artillery or air support are provided.",
    "Time gates are scenario-relative authoring assumptions. Phases are per-unit queues, not automatic synchronized formation barriers.",
    "Preserve the ORV as the link-up point. C Security provides depth; its anti-personnel weapons cannot guarantee stopping tanks."
  ],
